WEBVTT

00:00:03.127 --> 00:00:11.480
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi. I’m back. Linda! What are you doing at home?

00:00:12.782 --> 00:00:16.110
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> Hi, Dad. You’re very early.

00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:18.818
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, I got an early flight.

00:00:19.103 --> 00:00:21.273
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> Er, how was your day?

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:27.463
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> My day was fine. But what about your day? Why aren’t you at school?

00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:35.119
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> We didn’t have classes today. We went to the British Museum in the morning.

00:00:35.276 --> 00:00:39.238
It was great. And then we had lunch in the café there.

00:00:39.749 --> 00:00:42.031
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Why didn’t you go to school this afternoon?

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:46.729
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> We had a free afternoon. I stayed at home.

00:00:47.248 --> 00:00:48.282
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What did you do?

00:00:49.014 --> 00:00:52.875
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> I did my homework. I had a lot of work.

00:00:53.866 --> 00:00:56.833
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Good girl. When are your exams?

00:00:57.013 --> 00:00:57.858
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> They’re next week.

00:00:58.340 --> 00:00:59.142
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Where’s your mother?

00:00:59.509 --> 00:01:02.502
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> She went out. I think she went shopping.

00:01:03.952 --> 00:01:04.572
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What’s that?

00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:05.264
<v><b>Linda:</b></v> What?

00:01:06.046 --> 00:01:07.078
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> That noise.